   individuals behave more unethically than lower-class individuals. In studies 1 and
   2, upper-class individuals were more likely to break the law while driving, relative
   to ...</div></div><div data-visible-items-sm="2" data-visible-items-md="2" data-visible-items="2" data-truncate-less="less" data-truncate-dots="true" class="card-contribs authors text-reset authors-truncate"><ul class="list-inline" title="list of authors">
   <li class="list-inline-item"><a href="/author/Piff%2C+Paul+K" title="Paul K. Piff">Paul K. Piff</a>,</li>
