   same behavior is executed in the same context, regardless of the outcome. We introduce
   a machine learning method that discovers which of many context variables ...We apply a machine learning technique to characterize habit formation in two large
   panel data sets with objective measures of 1) gym attendance (over 12 million observations)
   and 2) hospital handwashing (over 40 million observations). Our Predicting ...</div></div><div data-visible-items-sm="2" data-visible-items-md="2" data-visible-items="2" data-truncate-less="less" data-truncate-dots="true" class="card-contribs authors text-reset authors-truncate"><ul class="list-inline" title="list of authors">
